Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:31.91,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Monid is the open router
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:31.91,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}for agent tools”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:01.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hey everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.05,0:00:01.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm Shengkun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Co-Founder and CEO of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:04.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Monid, and we are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:05.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,building the open router
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:06.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,for agent tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:07.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,We connect your agent to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:08.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,all the tools and API
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:09.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,they need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:10.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,and as a human
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:11.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,you don't need to sign
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:12.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,up for accounts or pay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:13.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,for subscription for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,those services anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:15.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,since your agent can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:17.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,easily discover and use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:18.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,all the tools and API
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:19.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,pay for them directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:22.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,For example
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,we have the Seedance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,API, ICO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Apollo, Semrush
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:27.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,and all different APIs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:28.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,that can directly help
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,you work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:31.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,And yes, we are open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:31.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,source.
